{"id":39657,"date":"2025-01-12T19:00:44","date_gmt":"2025-01-12T18:00:44","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-solidaria-nem-aac-2025\/"},"modified":"2026-08-24T09:24:08","modified_gmt":"2026-08-24T08:24:08","slug":"corrida-solidaria-nem-aac-2025","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-solidaria-nem-aac-2025\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida Solid\u00e1ria NEM\/AAC 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A&nbsp;<strong>IV Corrida Solid\u00e1ria<\/strong>&nbsp;\u00e9 um evento desportivo organizado pelo&nbsp;<strong>N\u00facleo de Estudantes de Medicina da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Acad\u00e9mica de Coimbra (NEM\/AAC)<\/strong>, com o apoio da&nbsp;<strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Coimbra<\/strong>, da&nbsp;<strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Acad\u00e9mica de Coimbra<\/strong>&nbsp;e da Recorde Pessoal, respons\u00e1vel pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica do evento.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Ser\u00e3o realizados dois eventos competitivos, uma&nbsp;<strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong>&nbsp;e outra de&nbsp;<strong>5 km<\/strong>, para fins competitivos e l\u00fadicos.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Quem pretender, poder\u00e1 fazer um trajeto de&nbsp;<strong>5 km de caminhada<\/strong>&nbsp;que ocorrer\u00e1 simultaneamente \u00e0 corrida, para fins l\u00fadicos.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As diversas modalidades ter\u00e3o partida e chegada na cidade de Coimbra, no dia\u00a0<strong>5 de abril<\/strong>.<\/p>\n\n\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":39658,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,28],"event_type_2":[37,727],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[811],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-39657","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-coimbra